  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::PassTheLight.Core.LevelRoot
  title: Around the barrier
  tip: Bounce the light around the wall.
  lesson: 'Some learners are cut off by barriers.


    Use two mirrors to guide
    the light around the wall. Every bounce follows i = r.'
  parMoves: 8
  hintFrom: {fileID: 670521587}
  hintTo: {fileID: 1940804827}
  quizQuestion: Angles of incidence and reflection are measured from the normal.
    The normal is a line...
  quizOptions:
  - along the mirror's surface
  - "at 90\xB0 to the mirror's surface"
  - "at 45\xB0 to the mirror's surface"
  correctOption: 1
  quizExplanation: "The normal is perpendicular (90\xB0) to the mirror's surface."
